# Local-only tooling that should never deploy
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
**/__tests__/**

# LWC config files
**/lwc/.eslintrc.json
**/lwc/jsconfig.json

# Jest mocks live inside the package dir but aren't deployable metadata
force-app/test/**

# Profiles are org-specific; the package ships permission sets instead
**/profiles/**

# Standard-object retrieval noise (we only ship the custom fields we add)
**/objectTranslations/**
package.xml

# Summer '26 platform bug: any Metadata API deploy containing CustomMetadata
# RECORDS gacks (UNKNOWN_EXCEPTION), which also breaks package version builds.
# The records stay in the repo as the source of truth, but ship via the
# Humanitix_Default_Mappings static resource and are seeded post-install by
# HumanitixMappingSeeder (Metadata.Operations is unaffected by the bug).
# Remove this exclusion once Salesforce fixes the gack.
**/customMetadata/**
